# Bundesverfassung der Schweizerischen Eidgenossenschaft (SR 101), German,
# consolidated as at 3 March 2024, from the Fedlex file store.
#
# Two reasons this one is here. It is long, formal Swiss German set by the
# Federal Chancellery, and it is full of real typographic no-break spaces -
# around 700 of them - which is exactly the material that tells a checker's
# space rules apart from a checker's guesses.
#
# It contains no quotation marks at all, so it says nothing about the Swiss
# guillemet rules. That is what admin-ch-medien-de-ch.urls is for, and the two
# corpora are deliberately not interchangeable.
#
# The URL carries its consolidation date, so it is immutable.
#
# format: html   region: <body>
https://www.fedlex.admin.ch/filestore/fedlex.data.admin.ch/eli/cc/1999/404/20240303/de/html/fedlex-data-admin-ch-eli-cc-1999-404-20240303-de-html.html
